  "description": "Rivon is the top of the food chain when it comes to the Ventus Series. It starts with a Ventus Series hybrid frame that features Rider Optimized Geometry specifically designed to assure a proper and comfortable fit. All Ventus Series models are ideally suited to a wide range of uses including commuting, fitness riding, recreational riding and Rivon does double duty as a very capable flat bar road bike. Unlike its Solum Series counterparts, Rivon uses a rigid Crmo steel fork with disc mounts to increase pedal efficiency by preventing energy loss associated with excess fork movement. Rivon comes complete with a Shimano 24 speed drive train that includes EZ Fire shifters. Its wheelset is made from Pivit alloy 28h disc hubs laced to DC-26 700c alloy double wall rims and stopping is made simple and reliable courtesy of a pair of Shimano M315 hydraulic disc brakes.\nHaro Ventus Hybrid frame, Rider Optimized Geometry, hydroformed alloy tubing, chainstay disc brake mount\nHaro Ventus alloy fork, Crmo steerer tube, post-mount disc brake\nShimano TY-501 48/38/28t crankset, sealed cartridge BB\nShimano Tourney TY-710 Dual Pull front derailleur\nShimano Altus 8-spd rear derailleur\nNew Shimano ST-EF510 3x8-spd shifters w/ hydraulic levers set\nShimano M315 hydraulic disc brakeset\nWide-ratio Shimano HG-200 12-32t 8-spd cassette\nPivit alloy 9 deg. backsweep flat-top bar & forged stem\nKenda Bitumen 700 x 32c tires\nPivit alloy disc 28h hubs w/ Alex DC-26 700c alloy DW rims",
